### Workspace category - 查询登录用户菜单应返回 category
POST http://127.0.0.1:9999/system/menu/current/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 断言建议
# 1. 响应 code = 200
# 2. data 为数组
# 3. 每个菜单节点包含 category 字段（system/business/app-center/settings）


### Workspace category - 菜单树应返回 category
GET http://127.0.0.1:9999/system/menu/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 断言建议
# 1. 响应 code = 200
# 2. data.list 为树结构
# 3. 每个节点包含 category 字段


### Workspace category - 保存菜单时写入 category
POST http://127.0.0.1:9999/system/menu/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "分类测试菜单",
  "name": "categoryTestMenu",
  "pid": "0",
  "type": "menu",
  "path": "/business/category-test",
  "component": "/business/category-test/index",
  "sort": 999,
  "status": 1,
  "category": "business"
}

### 断言建议
# 1. 响应 code = 200
# 2. 再次调用 /system/menu/tree 时可看到该菜单 category = business
